      "message": "Note: SSL libraries such as libring or libopenssl provide Pkey types. If we want to completely follow the spec, they might be replaced with these SSL types finally.\n\nHowever, it\u0027s a dilemma that neither OpenSSL nor BoringSSL provides traditional DH or P192 ECDH(only P256 ECDH is supported), not to mention SAFER.",
